## Why This Is Asked

This question probes practical testing of observability in a distributed system, ensuring monitoring, alerting, and logs stay correct during feature flag rollouts.

## Key Concepts

- Canary strategies and traffic splitting with feature flags
- Observability stack: Prometheus, Grafana, Loki, PagerDuty
- SLO mapping, alerting rules, and cross-service correlation

## Code Example

